g the records the caller did ask for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"access. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":" is never written: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"},{"text":" refuses it locally, before any request, as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"validation failure (CONTRACT.md §34.2 P12.2, contract 1.60 A4) — never as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\""},{"text":", never left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the server to refuse. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"text":" over these cases needs an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":" arm.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Which security posture a client is registered under (X5.1). This is the FAPI “one switch”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"FAPI 2.0 is not a single feature but a bundle of constraints — mandatory PAR, mandatory PKCE"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"code":"S256","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", mandatory strong client authentication, mandatory sender-constrained tokens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"nearly","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change at all, because "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"Self::Standard"},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and every row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClientProfile"}],"title":"ClientProfile","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClientProfile"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/Se","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SE","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SQ","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SH","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SY","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile/fapi2":{"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fapi2","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"title":"ClientProfile.fapi2","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile\/fapi2","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/fapi2","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile/encode(to:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/encode(to:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Refuses "},{"